 ["Photos, voice and text for the AI", "If the AI is on, the photo, voice recording or description of your meal (and, for the coach and the plan, the age, weight, goal and preferences you typed in your profile) is sent to our intermediate server (Cloudflare) and to Google Gemini only to answer. We don't keep it. You can turn the AI off in Settings. Progress photos are never sent."],
